# Manifold level 10
# The tower's first floor (stage 5d): the second beat, demanded, over the void (a fall, back to the
# last checkpoint). Up a chimney 2.4 m wide to a terrace 6 m up; across 2.5 m to a pillar (walking,
# 3.4); a ledge 3 m up (up to 3.25); and up a chimney 3.2 m wide over nothing to the goal, 15 m up.
# Stars: at the top of a chimney 2.4 m wide and 12 m high beside the start; on a pillar a running
# jump off the first terrace (5 m); and on a block 3 m high on the goal's terrace (its ledge).
title The first floor
spawn 0 1 7
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.85
sky 19.0

# The start, a balcony.
kit floor_4  -2 0 4
kit floor_4  2 0 4
kit floor_4  6 0 4
kit floor_4  -2 0 8
kit floor_4  2 0 8
kit floor_4  6 0 8

# Chimney 1, 2.4 m wide, its floor the balcony's, on from it; terrace B, 6 m up.
kit floor_2  0 0 -5
kit floor_2  0 0 -3
kit floor_2  0 0 -1
kit floor_2  0 0 1
kit wall_4  -1.35 -3 -4  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -1.35 0 -4  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -1.35 3 -4  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  1.35 -3 -4  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  1.35 0 -4  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  1.35 3 -4  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -2 -3 -6.15
kit wall_4  2 -3 -6.15
kit wall_4  -2 0 -6.15
kit wall_4  2 0 -6.15
kit wall_4  -2 3 -6.15
kit wall_4  2 3 -6.15
kit wall_4  -2 -3 -9.85
kit wall_4  2 -3 -9.85
kit wall_4  -2 0 -9.85
kit wall_4  2 0 -9.85
kit wall_4  -2 3 -9.85
kit wall_4  2 3 -9.85
kit wall_4  3.85 -3 -8  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  3.85 0 -8  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  3.85 3 -8  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -3.85 -3 -8  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -3.85 0 -8  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -3.85 3 -8  rotate y 90
kit floor_4  -2 6 -8
kit floor_4  2 6 -8

# Across 2.5 m: a pillar's top, 6 m up; a block, 3 m higher, 2 m on.
kit platform_2  0 3 -13.5
kit platform_2  0 4 -13.5
kit platform_2  0 5 -13.5
kit pillar  0 0 -13.5
kit wall_4  0 0 -16.15
kit wall_4  0 3 -16.15
kit wall_4  0 6 -16.15
kit wall_4  0 0 -19.85
kit wall_4  0 3 -19.85
kit wall_4  0 6 -19.85
kit wall_4  1.85 0 -18  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  1.85 3 -18  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  1.85 6 -18  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -1.85 0 -18  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -1.85 3 -18  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -1.85 6 -18  rotate y 90
kit floor_4  0 9 -18

# Chimney 2, 3.2 m wide, over nothing; the goal's terrace, 15 m up.
kit wall_4  -1.75 9 -22  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -1.75 12 -22  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  1.75 9 -22  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  1.75 12 -22  rotate y 90
kit wall_4  -2 9 -24.15
kit wall_4  2 9 -24.15
kit wall_4  -2 12 -24.15
kit wall_4  2 12 -24.15
kit wall_4  -2 9 -27.85
